<aside class="sidebar" id="sidebar">
  <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="VoxSekai — главная"
    ><span class="soundmark"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span
    ><span>voxsekai</span></a
  >
  <nav class="primary-nav" aria-label="Основная навигация">
    <a class="nav-link <%= currentPath === '/' ? 'active' : '' %>" href="/"
      ><span class="nav-icon">⌂</span>Главная</a
    >
    <a
      class="nav-link <%= currentPath === '/catalog' ? 'active' : '' %>"
      href="/catalog"
      ><span class="nav-icon">♫</span>Треки</a
    >
    <a
      class="nav-link <%= currentPath === '/artists' ? 'active' : '' %>"
      href="/artists"
      ><span class="nav-icon">♬</span>Исполнители</a
    >
    <a
      class="nav-link <%= currentPath === '/collections' ? 'active' : '' %>"
      href="/collections"
      ><span class="nav-icon">▱</span>Подборки</a
    >
    <a
      class="nav-link <%= currentPath === '/events' ? 'active' : '' %>"
      href="/events"
      ><span class="nav-icon">▦</span>События</a
    >
  </nav>
  <div class="side-collection">
    <p class="side-label">МОЯ МУЗЫКА</p>
    <a
      class="side-link <%= currentPath === '/playlists' || currentPath === '/create-playlist' ? 'active' : '' %>"
      href="/playlists"
      ><span>☷</span>Мои плейлисты</a
    >
    <a class="side-link <%= currentPath === '/favorites' ? 'active' : '' %>" href="/favorites"><span>♡</span>Избранное</a>
    <a
      class="side-link <%= currentPath === '/profile' ? 'active' : '' %>"
      href="/profile"
      ><span>⌁</span>Профиль</a
    >
    <div class="side-divider"></div>
    <a class="create-playlist" href="/create-playlist"
      >＋ Создать плейлист</a
    >
  </div>
  <div class="sidebar-about">
    <p>Твой голос. Твой мир.</p>
    <span>Всё бесплатно.<br />Без подписок.</span
    ><a href="/login">Войти ↗</a>
    <a href="/register">Создать аккаунт</a>
  </div>
</aside>
